#: config.cpp:40
msgid "Draw titlebar &stipple effect"
msgstr "Rysuj titlowy pas z &dypkami"

#: config.cpp:42
msgid ""
"When selected, active titlebars are drawn with a stipple (dotted) effect. "
"Otherwise, they are drawn without the stipple."
msgstr "Hdyž je tuta opcija wubrana, rysuja so titlowe pasy z dypkami."

#: config.cpp:46
msgid "Draw g&rab bar below windows"
msgstr "Přesuwanske &pasy pod woknami rysować."

#: config.cpp:48
msgid ""
"When selected, decorations are drawn with a \"grab bar\" below windows. "
"Otherwise, no grab bar is drawn."
msgstr "Wubjerće tutu opciju, chceće-li, zo so přesuwanski pas pod woknom rysuje."

#: config.cpp:54
msgid "Draw &gradients"
msgstr "Pře&chody barbow molować"

#: config.cpp:56
msgid ""
"When selected, decorations are drawn with gradients for highcolor displays, "
"otherwise no gradients are drawn."
msgstr ""
"Hdyž je tuta opcija wubrana, přeńdu dekoracije z jedneje barby do druheje, "
"jeli hardware to podpěruje. "

#~ msgid "Decoration Settings"
#~ msgstr "Nastajenja za dekoraciju woknow"

